    "name":  "LED Pendant Lamp - BOLBRO  - for E27 LED",
    "reference":  "91787",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eOur BOLBRO\u003cstrong\u003e Pendant Lamp\u003c/strong\u003e offers multiple styles for all types of decoration, stands out for its \u003cstrong\u003etransparent\u003c/strong\u003e color and has been manufactured in high strength \u003cstrong\u003eglass\u003c/strong\u003e. The lamp needs a \u003cstrong\u003ebulb\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eE27\u003c/strong\u003e socket for proper operation. In addition,\u003cstrong\u003e its height is adjustable\u003c/strong\u003e up to a maximum of \u003cstrong\u003e190cm\u003c/strong\u003e, so it can be adapted to various environments and rooms in the home or office.  \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003einstallation\u003c/strong\u003e is very \u003cstrong\u003esimple\u003c/strong\u003e and quick so that anyone can assemble it following the instructions. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe product does NOT include bulb, to review our E27 bulbs access through the button:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.factorled.com/es/130-bombillas-led-e27\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eE27 LED BULB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"margin:0px 0px 24px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003eClear BOLBRO Pendant Light\u0026nbsp;for E27 Bulbs\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eElegant, versatile lighting for any space\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eThe\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eglass pendant light\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003efor\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eE27\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ebulbs is an elegant, versatile choice for any interior space. Its simple, minimalist design suits any decorating style, from classic to contemporary. Its fittings, such as the lamp holder and the trim ring, are bronze coloured.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eThe light is made from\u0026nbsp;high-quality glass with a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eclear\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003efinish that gives it a modern, sophisticated look. The suspension cable is adjustable, so you can set the height of the light to suit your needs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eThe light takes\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eE27 bulbs\u003c/strong\u003e, so you can choose the one that best suits your lighting needs. LED bulbs are an ideal option, as they are energy efficient and produce a warm, pleasant light.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eFeatures:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin:4px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eSimple, minimalist design\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eMade from\u0026nbsp;high-strength\u0026nbsp;glass\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eClear\u0026nbsp;finish\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eAdjustable suspension cable\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBronze coloured fittings\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eTakes\u0026nbsp;E27 bulbs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBenefits:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin:4px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eElegant, versatile lighting\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eAdapts to any decorating style\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eEasy to install\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eSaves energy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eInstallation:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eTake the lamp holder and pass it through the hole in the shade.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eLock the shade in place with the threaded rings and tighten them onto the lamp holder.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eConnect the power cable.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eUse the \"screw\" to lock the pin into the \"mounting bracket\".\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eScrew in the light source. Flip the switch to test the light.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"margin:24px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eUses for the BOLBRO CLEAR LED Pendant Light for\u0026nbsp;E27 Bulbs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin:4px 0px;color:#1f1f1f;font-family:\u0027Google Sans\u0027, \u0027Helvetica Neue\u0027, sans-serif;font-size:16px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eKitchen\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eDining room\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eLiving room\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eBedroom\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14px;\"\u003eOffice\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
